---
const pathways = [
  {
    label: 'Topic hub',
    title: 'The Three Lenses',
    body:
      'Entertainment, geospatial intelligence, and finance as the recurring ways Alex reads the world.',
    href: '/lenses',
    meta: 'Identity / thesis',
  },
  {
    label: 'Finance case study',
    title: 'Franchise Index',
    body:
      'From a Jack in the Box refranchising thesis to a licensable public-company franchise index built with EQM Indexes.',
    href: '/franchise-index',
    meta: 'Finance / investing',
  },
  {
    label: 'Project gallery',
    title: 'Selected Work',
    body:
      'Geospatial tools, parcel and rail workflows, satellite-derived market signals, and the working pieces behind Item2.',
    href: '/work',
    meta: 'Geospatial / software',
  },
  {
    label: 'Long version',
    title: 'About Alex',
    body:
      'The fuller background: Hawaii, entertainment production, family offices, accounting, maps, litigation, and the resilience thread.',
    href: '/about',
    meta: 'Story / context',
  },
];
---

<section class="relative border-y border-hairline bg-paper-soft/45 py-14 md:py-20">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <p class="coord pt-1">04 / Explore</p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-heading max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-5xl">
          Pick the level of detail.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-copy mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg">
          The homepage orients quickly. The deeper pages separate the topics, projects, and long-form
          background so the site feels like a portfolio you can navigate instead of one endless scroll.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {pathways.map((path, index) => (
        <a
          href={path.href}
          class="group surface-quiet block rounded-md p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/55 hover:bg-paper-soft md:p-6"
        >
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="coord text-accent">{path.label}</p>
              <p class="coord mt-2">{path.meta}</p>
            </div>
            <span class="mono rounded-sm border border-hairline bg-paper-soft px-2 py-1 text-xs text-ink-muted transition-colors group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
              {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-10 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">
            {path.title}
          </h3>
          <p class="section-copy mt-4 text-sm md:text-base">
            {path.body}
          </p>
          <span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-accent">
            Open page <span class="mono text-xs transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
